hat's going on with the Lasombra is the opposite of Social Darwinism. It's just pure Foolish Darwinism.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":25523,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","user":"Shakanaka","date":". 09-08-2021, 08:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-08T05:55:50-07:00","id":1459287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1458685-clan-changes-in-the-camarilla-near-objectively-terrible-ideas?p=1459276#post1459276\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I took it more as:<br /> <br /> Ventrue: You are going to do what you were going to do anyway!<br /> <br /> Lasombra: Excellent! I mean, nooo! Please don't throw me in the briar patch!<br /> <br /> Ventrue: Oh, then welcome to the Ivory Tower.<br /> <br /> *Lasombra helps themselves to taking over*</div> </div> </div> </div>i ain't judging, if the lasombra wanted to go fuck themselves that's there buisness","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25992-archderd","